    "meta_description": "Thought it was time to give Dolce another B&W photoshoot. She was just hanging out on the couch. She is a miniature Siberian Husky (28lbs). The sweetest dog ever! As always old Nikon glass looks great! This pic looks a little deceptive. Her eyes suggest that I had a single strobe on her when actually it was natural light with a wind behind me as the sun was setting.\n\t\n\tEOS 5D\n\tNikkor-S 55 f1.2 at 2.0\n\tPost in Aperture"
